e Naturals Moisture Care tuh\u00e9 m\u00fddlo 90 g","productInHouse":{"globusBonusCredit":null,"actualPrice":14.9,"originalPrice":null,"discountPercentage":null,"priceValidFrom":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000+02:00","priceValidTo":"2026-10-20T23:59:59.000+02:00","houseNumber":4005,"houseName":"Globus \u010cR, v.o.s. \u010cakovice ","placements":[{"placement":"32110050","facing":3,"presentationType":0,"presentationStock":18,"planogramKey":"329588","name":"Mydlo_3RJ_05_Cako","category":"Kosmetika","subcategory":"Mydla","department":"Drogerie"}],"modified":"2026-10-07T14:39:31.000+02:00","stockAmount":0,"minimumPresentationStock":18,"priceTagId":"12","priceType":"VKA0","comparisonPrice":16.56,"comparisonSaleUnitSizeText":"100,00 g","baseComparisonPrice":165.56,"baseComparisonSaleUnitSizeText":"1 kg","securityTag":false,"availability":"P","blickPunkt":true,"customerClubDiscounts":[],"modifiedStockAmount":"2026-10-08T07:06:53.000+02:00","bonusProgramPrice":{"actualPrice":12.9,"originalPrice":14.9,"discount":13,"priceValidFrom":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000+02:00","priceValidTo":"2026-10-20T23:59:59.000+02:00","priceTagId":null,"comparisonPrice":14.33,"comparisonSaleUnitSizeText":"100,00 g","baseComparisonPrice":143.33,"baseComparisonSaleUnitSizeText":"1 kg"},"GraphicId":121,"Color":"1","isActive":true},"unitId":"g","unitAmount":90,"placementOrder":0,"imgIcon":"https:\/\/gapi.globus.cz\/OnlineAsset\/3\/asset?assetID=12ba370b-e3c4-4ec9-a6fa-6b8387d0e85a&type=3","imgThumbnail":"https:\/\/gapi.globus.cz\/OnlineAsset\/3\/asset?assetID=12ba370b-e3c4-4ec9-a6fa-6b8387d0e85a&type=2","alias":["myc\u00ed gel","tekut\u00e9 m\u00fddlo"],"modified":"2026-10-08T19:51:59.000+02:00","imageStepURL":null,"priceCheckerHasPicture":false,"stepID":null,"rabatNumber":null,"originalRebateId":null,"IsBaseVariant":false,"ribbon":[],"badges":[],"calculatedPrice":{"currentPrice":14.9,"normalPrice":0}},{"brand":null,"description":"\u00dastn\u00ed voda LISTERINE\u00ae COOL MINT:<br>D\u00edky jedine\u010dn\u00e9 kombinaci esenci\u00e1ln\u00edch olej\u016f \u00fa\u010dinn\u011b bojuje proti bakteri\u00edm i tam, kam se zubn\u00ed kart\u00e1\u010dek nedostane: mezi zuby, na d\u00e1sn\u00edch a na jazyku<br>Omezuje zubn\u00ed plak a chr\u00e1n\u00ed p\u0159ed jeho vznikem<br>Intenzivn\u00ed m\u00e1tov\u00e1 chu\u0165 poskytuje trvalou jistotu sv\u011b\u017e\u00edho dechu<br>L\u00e1hev je vyroben\u00e1 z 50% z recyklovan\u00e9ho plastu a 100% recyklovateln\u00e1<br>Vhodn\u00e1 pro dosp\u011bl\u00e9 a d\u011bti od 12 let<br>Pro dlouhodob\u00e9 pou\u017eit\u00ed<br>Pro\u010d pou\u017e\u00edvat \u00fastn\u00ed vodu LISTERINE\u00ae? Vyplachov\u00e1n\u00ed \u00fast dvakr\u00e1t denn\u011b nen\u00ed jen skv\u011bl\u00fdm zp\u016fsobem, jak si zachovat sv\u011b\u017e\u00ed dech. Je to kl\u00ed\u010d k tomu, aby cel\u00e1 va\u0161e \u00fasta byla \u010dist\u00e1. Je pravda, \u017ee samotn\u00fdm \u010di\u0161t\u011bn\u00edm zubn\u00edm kart\u00e1\u010dkem vy\u010dist\u00edte pouze 25 % \u00fast. S\u00edla \u00fastn\u00ed vody poraz\u00ed bakterie ve va\u0161\u00ed \u00fastn\u00ed dutin\u011b, na zubech i d\u00e1sn\u00edch. LISTERINE\u00ae m\u00e1 klinicky prok\u00e1zan\u00fd antibakteri\u00e1ln\u00ed \u00fa\u010dinek \u2013 obsahuje unik\u00e1tn\u00ed kombinaci 4 esenci\u00e1ln\u00edch olej\u016f, z\u00e1rove\u0148 v\u0161ak \u00fastn\u00ed fl\u00f3ra z\u016fst\u00e1v\u00e1 v rovnov\u00e1ze. P\u0159i pou\u017eit\u00ed dvakr\u00e1t denn\u011b LISTERINE\u00ae odstra\u0148uje bakterie, kter\u00e9 v \u00fastech z\u016fst\u00e1vaj\u00ed po \u010di\u0161t\u011bn\u00ed zub\u016f. Bylo prok\u00e1z\u00e1no, \u017ee LISTERINE\u00ae zlep\u0161uje va\u0161i \u00fastn\u00ed hygienu a \u00fa\u010dinkuje v m\u00edstech, kter\u00e9 jsou zubn\u00edm kart\u00e1\u010dkem obt\u00ed\u017en\u011b dosa\u017eiteln\u00e9. Z\u00e1rove\u0148 tak\u00e9 omezuje a p\u0159edch\u00e1z\u00ed tvorb\u011b zubn\u00edho plaku, jedn\u00e9 z hlavn\u00edch p\u0159\u00ed\u010din probl\u00e9m\u016f s d\u00e1sn\u011bmi, a osv\u011b\u017e\u00ed v\u00e1\u0161 dech.","contains":"PR-0002631] Aqua, Alcohol, Sorbitol, Poloxamer 407, Benzoic Acid, Sodium Saccharin, Eucalyptol, Methyl Salicylate, Thymol, Sodium Benzoate, Menthol, Aroma, CI 42053. Obsahuje alkohol.","imgDetail":"https:\/\/gapi.globus.cz\/OnlineAsset\/3\/asset?assetID=d7a74e43-fea3-4770-8a98-46de134358b6&type=1","allergens":[],"nutritionValues":[],"producer":"JNTL CONSUMER HEALTH (Czech Republic) s.r.o.","producerId":"30101","storage":null,"productCategories":[],"hasFictiveStock":false,"originalRebateIds":null,"sellUnitSizeText":"2x 600 ml","countriesOfOrigin":["IT"],"commonBrand":{"id":"12124","name":"Listerine"},"ageLimitation":null,"baseVariantQuantity":1,"articleType":0,"billName":"LISTERINE 2X600ML","pointRelevant":false,"regulatedName":"LISTERINE MINT DUOPACK  2X600 ML","otherLegalRequirements":"","containsMicronutrients":false,"qcommSell":null,"micronutrients":[],"matlType":"ZHAW","valClass":"Z300","ean":["3574661863436"],"vanr":"02377003004","productTagIds":[],"warengroup":"645W2113","name":"LISTERINE\u00ae COOL MINT Duopack 2x 600 ml","productInHouse":{"globusBonusCredit":null,"actualPrice":129.9,"originalPrice":null,"discountPercentage":null,"priceValidFrom":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000+02:00","priceValidTo":"2026-10-20T23:59:59.000+02:00","houseNumber":4005,"houseName":"Globus \u010cR, v.o.s. \u010cakovice ","placements":null,"modified":"2026-10-05T23:22:05.000+02:00","stockAmount":106,"minimumPresentationStock":0,"priceTagId":"12","priceType":"VKA0","comparisonPrice":129.9,"comparisonSaleUnitSizeText":"1,00 ks","baseComparisonPrice":129.9,"baseComparisonSaleUnitSizeText":"1,00 ks","securityTag":false,"availability":"A","blickPunkt":true,"customerClubDiscounts":[],"modifiedStockAmount":"2026-10-08T20:26:04.000+02:00","bonusProgramPrice":null,"GraphicId":121,"Color":"1","isActive":true},"unitId":"KS","unitAmount":1,"placementOrder":0,"imgIcon":"https:\/\/gapi.globus.cz\/OnlineAsset\/3\/asset?assetID=d7a74e43-fea3-4770-8a98-46