u017e\u00ed a jako znovuzrozen\u00ed. Svou obl\u00edbenou aviv\u00e1\u017e od zna\u010dky Lenor pou\u017e\u00edvejte spole\u010dn\u011b s vonn\u00fdmi perli\u010dkami na pran\u00ed od zna\u010dky Lenor Unstoppables, kter\u00e9 jej\u00ed v\u016fni n\u00e1dhern\u011b dopln\u00ed.","contains":"<5% kationtov\u00e9 povrchov\u011b aktivn\u00ed l\u00e1tky; parf\u00e9my,  Amyl Salicylate,  Citronellol,  Coumarin,  Dimethyl Phenethyl Acetate,  Eugenol,  Geraniol,  Hexyl cinnamal,  Linalool,  Pogostemon Cablin Oil,  Tetramethyl Acetyloctahydronaphthalenes.","imgDetail":"https:\/\/gapi.globus.cz\/OnlineAsset\/3\/asset?assetID=8b1656c9-6bb6-4cee-8326-be78c854be5b&type=1","allergens":[],"nutritionValues":[],"producer":"PROCTER & GAMBLE CZECH REPUBLIC S.R.O.","producerId":"37657","storage":null,"productCategories":["cls_czr_fabric_softener","cls_czr_detergents_and_softeners","cls_czr_drugstore_and_cosmetics","cls_czr_click_and_collect"],"hasFictiveStock":false,"originalRebateIds":null,"sellUnitSizeText":"59 pran\u00ed","countriesOfOrigin":["CZ"],"commonBrand":{"id":"12096","name":"Lenor"},"ageLimitation":null,"baseVariantQuantity":1,"articleType":0,"billName":"LENOR SPRING AW.59D","pointRelevant":false,"regulatedName":"","otherLegalRequirements":"","containsMicronutrients":false,"qcommSell":true,"micronutrients":[],"matlType":"ZHAW","valClass":"Z300","ean":["8700216724012"],"vanr":"02342286005","productTagIds":["CMW29","CMW17"],"warengroup":"650W1211","name":"Lenor Aviv\u00e1\u017e Spring Awakening 59 \/ 1,25l","productInHouse":{"globusBonusCredit":null,"actualPrice":99.9,"originalPrice":null,"discountPercentage":null,"priceValidFrom":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000+02:00","priceValidTo":"2026-10-20T23:59:59.000+02:00","houseNumber":4005,"houseName":"Globus \u010cR, v.o.s. \u010cakovice ","placements":[{"placement":"31202020","facing":2,"presentationType":2,"presentationStock":6,"planogramKey":"1895203","name":"Copy of Avivaze_6RJ_05_Cakovice_NOVA","category":"Praci prostredky","subcategory":"Avivaze","department":"Drogerie"}],"modified":"2026-10-05T23:22:04.000+02:00","stockAmount":40,"minimumPresentationStock":6,"priceTagId":"12","priceType":"VKA0","comparisonPrice":1.69,"comparisonSaleUnitSizeText":"1,00 pd","baseComparisonPrice":1.69,"baseComparisonSaleUnitSizeText":"1,00 pd","securityTag":false,"availability":"A","blickPunkt":true,"customerClubDiscounts":[],"modifiedStockAmount":"2026-10-08T18:26:02.000+02:00","bonusProgramPrice":{"actualPrice":79.9,"originalPrice":99.9,"discount":20,"priceValidFrom":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000+02:00","priceValidTo":"2026-10-20T23:59:59.000+02:00","priceTagId":null,"comparisonPrice":1.35,"comparisonSaleUnitSizeText":"1,00 pd","baseComparisonPrice":1.35,"baseComparisonSaleUnitSizeText":"1,00 pd"},"GraphicId":121,"Color":"1","isActive":true},"unitId":"PD","unitAmount":59,"placementOrder":0,"imgIcon":"https:\/\/gapi.globus.cz\/OnlineAsset\/3\/asset?assetID=8b1656c9-6bb6-4cee-8326-be78c854be5b&type=3","imgThumbnail":"https:\/\/gapi.globus.cz\/OnlineAsset\/3\/asset?assetID=8b1656c9-6bb6-4cee-8326-be78c854be5b&type=2","alias":[],"modified":"2026-10-06T13:09:33.000+02:00","imageStepURL":null,"priceCheckerHasPicture":false,"stepID":null,"rabatNumber":null,"originalRebateId":null,"IsBaseVariant":false,"ribbon":[],"badges":{"vCZProduct":{"display":true}},"calculatedPrice":{"currentPrice":99.9,"normalPrice":0}},{"brand":null,"description":"Nov\u00e9? NE, vypran\u00e9 v gelu Perwoll Black!<br>Objevte tekut\u00fd prac\u00ed prost\u0159edek Perwoll Black s nov\u00fdm slo\u017een\u00edm Triple Renew, kter\u00fd poskytuje ide\u00e1ln\u00ed p\u00e9\u010di o tmav\u00e9 oble\u010den\u00ed! Tento prac\u00ed prost\u0159edek na tmav\u00e9 pr\u00e1dlo nejen \u0161etrn\u011b \u010dist\u00ed, ale tak\u00e9 poskytuje tu nejlep\u0161\u00ed p\u00e9\u010di o vl\u00e1kna, tak\u017ee va\u0161e tmav\u00e9 oble\u010den\u00ed bude vypadat jako nov\u00e9! To v\u0161e v kombinaci se skv\u011blou v\u016fn\u00ed, kter\u00e1 zabezpe\u010duje dlouhotrvaj\u00edc\u00ed sv\u011b\u017eest oble\u010den\u00ed. Prac\u00ed gel je \u00fa\u010dinn\u00fd jak ve studen\u00e9, tak tepl\u00e9 vod\u011b a je vhodn\u00fd i pro ru\u010dn\u00ed myt\u00ed. Tekut\u00fd prac\u00ed prost\u0159edek na oble\u010den\u00ed Perwoll je vhodn\u00fd pro pran\u00ed r\u016fzn\u00fdch druh\u016f tkanin.<br><br>V\u00fdhody prac\u00edho gelu Perwoll Black s nov\u00fdm slo\u017een\u00edm Triple Renew: <br>Obnova vl\u00e1ken<br>Obnova barev<br>Lep\u0161\u00ed sv\u011b\u017eest<br><br>Zvolte si Perwoll, prac\u00ed prost\u0159edek ur\u010den\u00fd pro tmav\u00e9 pr\u00e1dlo, kter\u00fd p\u0159esahuje r\u00e1mec b\u011b\u017en\u00e9ho \u010di\u0161t\u011bn\u00ed, a dop\u0159ejte sv\u00e9mu oble\u010den\u00ed p\u00e9\u010di, kterou si zaslou\u017e\u00ed.<br><br>Pe\u010dujte o sv\u00e9 oble\u010den\u00ed i o planetu: Slo\u017een\u00ed obsahuje v\u00edce ne\u017e 95 % p\u0159\u00edrodn\u011b z\u00edskan\u00fdch ingredienc\u00ed*.<br>* Dok\u00e1z\u00e1no laborato\u0159\u00ed Henkel (N\u011bmecko, 2021).","contains":null,"imgDetail":"https:\/\/gapi.globus.cz\/OnlineAsset\/3\/asset?assetID=e6291d90-4dde-450f-8c98-22bc8a5cb218&type=1","allergens":[],"nutritionValues":[],"producer":"HENKEL \u010cR, SPOL. S R.O.","producerId":"32832","storage":null,"productCategories":["cls_czr_special_detergents","cls_czr_detergents_and_softeners","cls_czr_drugstore_and_cosmetics","cls_czr_click_and_collect"],"hasFictiveStock":false,"originalRebateIds":null,"sellUnitSizeText":"80 pran\u00ed","countriesOfOrigin":["HU"],"commonBrand":{"id":"16094","name":"Perwoll"},"ageLimitation":null,"baseVariantQuantity":1,"articleType":0,"billName":"PERWOLL BLACK 80D","pointRelevant":false,"regulatedName":"","otherLegalRequirements":"","containsMicronutrients":false,"qcommSell":false,"micronutrients":[],"matlType":"ZHAW","valClass":"Z300","ean":["9000101810264"],"vanr":"02319067002","productTagIds":[],"warengroup":"650W2417","name":"Perwoll prac\u00ed gel Black 4000ml, 80 d\u00e1vek","produ