ified":"2026-10-06T10:42:20.000+02:00","imageStepURL":null,"priceCheckerHasPicture":false,"stepID":null,"rabatNumber":null,"originalRebateId":null,"IsBaseVariant":false,"ribbon":[],"badges":[],"calculatedPrice":{"currentPrice":399.9,"normalPrice":0}},{"brand":null,"description":"Hled\u00e1te jednodu\u0161\u0161\u00ed zp\u016fsob, jak udr\u017eet va\u0161i toaletu \u010distou a sv\u011b\u017e\u00ed? WC blok je snadn\u00fd a pohodln\u00fd zp\u016fsob, jak zajistit \u010distotu ve va\u0161\u00ed toalet\u011b od prvn\u00edho do posledn\u00edho spl\u00e1chnut\u00ed. Bref Color Aktiv + m\u00e1 speci\u00e1ln\u00ed ko\u0161\u00ed\u010dek a modr\u00e9 kuli\u010dky, kter\u00e9 jsou aktivov\u00e1ny s ka\u017ed\u00fdm spl\u00e1chnut\u00edm a zbarvuj\u00ed vodu do modra k zaji\u0161t\u011bn\u00ed viditeln\u00e9ho \u010di\u0161t\u011bn\u00ed. WC blok m\u00e1 slo\u017een\u00ed se 4 funkcemi: <br>1) \u010cistic\u00ed p\u011bna \u010dist\u00ed toaletu s ka\u017ed\u00fdm spl\u00e1chnut\u00edm<br>2) Ochrana proti vodn\u00edmu kameni zabra\u0148uje tvorb\u011b vodn\u00edho kamene v toalet\u011b. <br>3) Ochrana proti ne\u010distot\u00e1m zabra\u0148uje usazov\u00e1n\u00ed ne\u010distot.  <br>4) Extra sv\u011b\u017eest zanech\u00e1v\u00e1 dlouhotrvaj\u00edc\u00ed sv\u011b\u017e\u00ed v\u016fni v koupeln\u011b.  <br>Jednodu\u0161e zav\u011bste WC blok pod okraj toaletn\u00ed m\u00edsy a nasm\u011brujte do proudu vody. Po spl\u00e1chnut\u00ed toalety za\u017eijte viditeln\u00e9 \u010di\u0161t\u011bn\u00ed s modrou vodou. <br>Bref WC blok tak\u00e9 zaji\u0161\u0165uje sv\u011b\u017eest eukalyptu v koupeln\u011b a o 50 % v\u00edce lesku (v porovn\u00e1n\u00ed se such\u00fdm povrchem bez pou\u017eit\u00ed WC bloku), d\u00edky \u010distic\u00edm polymer\u016fm ve slo\u017een\u00ed.","contains":">30% aniontov\u00e9 povrchov\u011b aktivn\u00ed l\u00e1tky, 5-15% neiontov\u00e9 povrchov\u011b aktivn\u00ed l\u00e1tky, Parf\u00e9my (limonene)","imgDetail":"https:\/\/gapi.globus.cz\/OnlineAsset\/3\/a